1
00:00:04,882 --> 00:00:06,050
<c.simplifiedchinese>有事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:06,135 --> 00:00:07,386
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:07,470 --> 00:00:09,973
<c.simplifiedchinese>对 他说可能会晚点回来</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:10,059 --> 00:00:11,352
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:12,188 --> 00:00:14,482
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是很奇怪啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:14,569 --> 00:00:18,281
<c.simplifiedchinese>除了这里 剑心还能有什么事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:19,662 --> 00:00:21,831
<c.simplifiedchinese>-我知道了 是女人！
-什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:21,916 --> 00:00:25,628
<c.simplifiedchinese>他来这里也有三个月了
肯定有一两个…</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:25,716 --> 00:00:26,967
<c.simplifiedchinese>疼！</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:27,051 --> 00:00:29,888
<c.simplifiedchinese>你怎么会有这种想法！</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:29,974 --> 00:00:31,392
<c.simplifiedchinese>你也不用打我吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:31,477 --> 00:00:33,020
<c.simplifiedchinese>不好意思</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:34,609 --> 00:00:38,988
<c.simplifiedchinese>我听说绯村拔刀斋先生住在这家道场</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:00:39,786 --> 00:00:45,249
<c.simplifiedchinese>对了 我是刚被分配到镇上的藤田</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:00:45,338 --> 00:00:47,507
<c.simplifiedchinese>绯村先生的事是局长告诉我的</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:00:49,806 --> 00:00:53,684
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来是警察局长的下属啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:00:53,772 --> 00:00:58,068
<c.simplifiedchinese>真不巧
现在剑心不在 有什么事吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:00:58,155 --> 00:00:59,740
<c.simplifiedchinese>是这样</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:00:59,826 --> 00:01:01,577
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然还没有得到确认</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:01:01,663 --> 00:01:06,835
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我们接到消息
绯村先生被一伙不法之徒盯上了</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:01:06,923 --> 00:01:10,969
<c.simplifiedchinese>很不好意思 我可以在这里等他吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:01:11,473 --> 00:01:12,349
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:01:12,433 --> 00:01:15,645
<c.simplifiedchinese>他可能会晚点回来
要是你不介意的话…</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:01:15,732 --> 00:01:16,567
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:01:18,154 --> 00:01:19,446
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:30,173
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:02:59,397 --> 00:03:01,775
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑被人盯上了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:01,861 --> 00:03:02,737
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:02,820 --> 00:03:05,073
<c.simplifiedchinese>大概就是他们杀了左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:05,159 --> 00:03:06,994
<c.simplifiedchinese>他还没有…</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,039
<c.simplifiedchinese>死啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:08,624 --> 00:03:13,670
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是如果这是真的
那他们一定是一伙穷凶极恶的家伙</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:03:14,177 --> 00:03:17,597
<c.simplifiedchinese>接下来我们要十分小心</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:03:18,102 --> 00:03:19,019
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:03:19,104 --> 00:03:22,482
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是最关键的剑心不在…</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:03:23,654 --> 00:03:26,073
<c.simplifiedchinese>阿剑即使一个人也不需要我们担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:03:26,868 --> 00:03:30,288
<c.simplifiedchinese>总之现在我们不能出去到处找他</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:03:30,376 --> 00:03:34,880
<c.simplifiedchinese>至少局长派来的剑客警官在这</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:03:34,969 --> 00:03:36,429
<c.simplifiedchinese>道场比外面更安全</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:03:37,223 --> 00:03:38,516
<c.simplifiedchinese>这倒也是</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:03:43,610 --> 00:03:44,820
<c.simplifiedchinese>诶…</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:03:45,322 --> 00:03:48,659
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以为所有的警官都佩军刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:03:48,745 --> 00:03:50,456
<c.simplifiedchinese>也有佩日本刀的啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:03:50,541 --> 00:03:53,377
<c.simplifiedchinese>军刀太脆弱 不够可靠</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:03:53,464 --> 00:03:56,383
<c.simplifiedchinese>我有佩日本刀的特别许可</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:03:57,263 --> 00:04:00,933
<c.simplifiedchinese>刀果然还是日本刀最好啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:04,611 --> 00:04:06,029
<c.simplifiedchinese>死了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:06,865 --> 00:04:10,827
<c.simplifiedchinese>竟然能挨上六下</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:11,416 --> 00:04:14,544
<c.simplifiedchinese>我答应你在墓前说出真相</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:14,631 --> 00:04:20,512
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤和我跟刃卫一样
是政治家雇佣的暗杀者</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:04:21,019 --> 00:04:24,564
<c.simplifiedchinese>其实我也不清楚他们杀你的原因</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:04:24,651 --> 00:04:26,903
<c.simplifiedchinese>恐怕因为黑笠事件</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:04:26,989 --> 00:04:29,784
<c.simplifiedchinese>大人物知道了你的存在</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:04:30,371 --> 00:04:32,790
<c.simplifiedchinese>害怕你说出幕末时他们做的坏事</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:04:32,875 --> 00:04:35,836
<c.simplifiedchinese>才让我们杀掉你吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:04:36,341 --> 00:04:37,634
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:04:38,512 --> 00:04:43,058
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤一和鹈堂刃卫都是暗杀者啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:04:43,981 --> 00:04:49,194
<c.simplifiedchinese>没记错的话
斋藤在新选组的肃清队士中</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:04:49,284 --> 00:04:54,831
<c.simplifiedchinese>也是最常挥剑进行暗杀的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:04:54,919 --> 00:04:58,673
<c.simplifiedchinese>这家伙挨了六下竟然还没事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:04:59,262 --> 00:05:03,891
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使到了这个时代
那个男人还在做这种蠢事啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:07,692
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管还要多少次 我都要杀了你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:11,119 --> 00:05:12,203
<c.simplifiedchinese>糟了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:12,288 --> 00:05:13,247
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的双手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:23,769 --> 00:05:24,770
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:25,272 --> 00:05:27,191
<c.simplifiedchinese>-薰小姐
-哎！</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:05:27,276 --> 00:05:28,653
<c.simplifiedchinese>你受伤了</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:05:29,238 --> 00:05:31,491
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真的被人盯上了</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:05:32,536 --> 00:05:33,621
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:05:33,705 --> 00:05:35,207
<c.simplifiedchinese>你从哪里听说的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:05:35,292 --> 00:05:36,710
<c.simplifiedchinese>从警察那里</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:05:36,795 --> 00:05:39,798
<c.simplifiedchinese>局长先生的部下过来告诉我们的</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:05:41,011 --> 00:05:43,389
<c.simplifiedchinese>警视厅的警部补 剑客警官</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:05:43,475 --> 00:05:45,018
<c.simplifiedchinese>藤田五郎先生</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:05:48,235 --> 00:05:50,070
<c.simplifiedchinese>看你的样子</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:05:50,155 --> 00:05:53,659
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤末让你费了不少工夫啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:05:55,499 --> 00:05:58,293
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真是变弱了很多</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:00,342 --> 00:06:05,389
<c.simplifiedchinese>最后一次对决还是在鸟羽伏见的战场</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:06,061 --> 00:06:07,980
<c.simplifiedchinese>大约有十年没见了</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:08,065 --> 00:06:09,859
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年？</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:09,944 --> 00:06:14,574
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样啊 你现在改名叫藤田五郎了</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:15,330 --> 00:06:17,541
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组第三小队队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:06:18,211 --> 00:06:19,629
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤一</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:06:21,426 --> 00:06:23,178
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组？</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:06:23,263 --> 00:06:24,139
<c.simplifiedchinese>那…</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:06:24,223 --> 00:06:26,809
<c.simplifiedchinese>盯上剑心的就是这家伙！</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:06:28,147 --> 00:06:29,273
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:06:29,358 --> 00:06:35,990
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有短短两个字
真正经历下来却是很漫长的一段岁月</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:06:36,079 --> 00:06:37,206
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:06:37,291 --> 00:06:40,211
<c.simplifiedchinese>漫长到足够让一个人腐化</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:06:42,301 --> 00:06:43,677
<c.simplifiedchinese>以前的你</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:06:43,762 --> 00:06:46,848
<c.simplifiedchinese>尽管难以捉摸实力强大</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:06:46,935 --> 00:06:52,023
<c.simplifiedchinese>但总是堂堂正正进行决斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:06:53,155 --> 00:06:57,535
<c.simplifiedchinese>伤害对方的朋友让他动摇</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:06:57,623 --> 00:07:03,045
<c.simplifiedchinese>派遣走狗缠着对方又趁机威胁人质
这种肮脏手段你从来不会用</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:03,635 --> 00:07:08,890
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在的你根本不是
在下认同的那个武士斋藤一</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:21,627
<c.simplifiedchinese>混蛋！有什么好笑的？</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:22,339 --> 00:07:24,425
<c.simplifiedchinese>很好笑啊 小子</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:24,510 --> 00:07:26,596
<c.simplifiedchinese>真的很好笑</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:26,681 --> 00:07:28,850
<c.simplifiedchinese>我知道你的剑术退步了</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:28,935 --> 00:07:31,646
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到脑子也变得这么迟钝</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:07:31,733 --> 00:07:32,609
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:07:32,693 --> 00:07:35,237
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤末是我的走狗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:07:35,324 --> 00:07:36,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>真可笑</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:07:36,826 --> 00:07:39,662
<c.simplifiedchinese>我会养一个那样的废物吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:07:40,459 --> 00:07:45,005
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们新选组与刽子手拔刀斋交手最多</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:07:45,092 --> 00:07:47,929
<c.simplifiedchinese>也最清楚你的实力</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:07:48,516 --> 00:07:53,104
<c.simplifiedchinese>但现在一个赤末都让你这么头疼</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:07:53,192 --> 00:07:58,113
<c.simplifiedchinese>成为不杀的浪客让你明显变弱了</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:07:59,287 --> 00:08:00,455
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:01,041 --> 00:08:02,167
<c.simplifiedchinese>变弱了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:03,630 --> 00:08:06,883
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤 你怎么想无所谓</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:07,471 --> 00:08:11,141
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在的在下要保护身边的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:11,228 --> 00:08:13,855
<c.simplifiedchinese>只要有浪客的实力就足够了</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:15,111 --> 00:08:19,782
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经不需要刽子手那样的强大力量了</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:22,041 --> 00:08:23,459
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:25,172 --> 00:08:27,675
<c.simplifiedchinese>浪客的实力…</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:27,761 --> 00:08:28,887
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:08:28,972 --> 00:08:32,892
<c.simplifiedchinese>这么说的话
你现在连做浪客都不够格</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:08:36,654 --> 00:08:40,950
<c.simplifiedchinese>当你中了我的圈套与赤末苦战的时候</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:08:41,622 --> 00:08:43,958
<c.simplifiedchinese>我一直都在这里</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:08:44,628 --> 00:08:45,588
<c.simplifiedchinese>也就是说</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:08:46,256 --> 00:08:50,052
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果我想杀这些人 随时都能动手</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:08:51,851 --> 00:08:54,145
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅仅是这一次</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:08:54,899 --> 00:09:00,404
<c.simplifiedchinese>你说着要保护身边的人
却不止一次让他们落入敌手</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:00,494 --> 00:09:06,917
<c.simplifiedchinese>结果连雷十太这种蠢货
都能给你身边的人造成终身的伤害</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:10,304 --> 00:09:13,974
<c.simplifiedchinese>雷十太事件
应该没有传到警察那里才对…</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:14,855 --> 00:09:18,526
<c.simplifiedchinese>难道他从很久之前就监视着剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:19,532 --> 00:09:22,326
<c.simplifiedchinese>这种不可靠的力量等于没有</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:22,830 --> 00:09:27,376
<c.simplifiedchinese>只会嘴上说说的伪善者只会让人不快</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:27,463 --> 00:09:32,426
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴！
就是因为剑心才没有一个人死掉啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:32,515 --> 00:09:35,893
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是今后可不一定这么顺利吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:39,070 --> 00:09:40,405
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:41,283 --> 00:09:47,581
<c.simplifiedchinese>我想着这么浅薄的道理
拔刀斋一定会明白 所以派出了赤末</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:09:47,671 --> 00:09:53,468
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像你说的那样
十年漫长到足够让一个人腐化</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:09:54,350 --> 00:09:56,394
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么立下不杀之誓的浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:09:56,479 --> 00:09:59,441
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过是为了自我满足
沉浸在所谓的正义里</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:09:59,527 --> 00:10:04,115
<c.simplifiedchinese>刽子手拔刀斋如果不杀人
还怎么保护别人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:10:05,164 --> 00:10:06,582
<c.simplifiedchinese>你忘了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:07,168 --> 00:10:09,712
<c.simplifiedchinese>恶 即 斩</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:10,216 --> 00:10:12,593
<c.simplifiedchinese>若为邪恶则立斩之！</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:12,679 --> 00:10:16,975
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是新选组和刽子手</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:17,563 --> 00:10:19,774
<c.simplifiedchinese>唯一共有的真正正义</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:21,238 --> 00:10:25,909
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在的你简直让我无法容忍</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:27,166 --> 00:10:28,209
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:28,962 --> 00:10:34,676
<c.simplifiedchinese>不论你说什么 在下都不会再杀人</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:37,813 --> 00:10:38,647
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:43,156 --> 00:10:44,116
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:45,286 --> 00:10:48,080
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要否定你的一切</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:59,397 --> 00:11:00,315
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:11:00,900 --> 00:11:07,032
<c.simplifiedchinese>再愣着 想让旁边的小姑娘和那小子
也尝尝牙突的滋味吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:11:14,887 --> 00:11:16,096
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰小姐？</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:11:21,107 --> 00:11:22,567
<c.simplifiedchinese>没事的</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:11:22,651 --> 00:11:23,486
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:11:23,570 --> 00:11:26,948
<c.simplifiedchinese>无论如何 他已经盯上了在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:11:27,453 --> 00:11:29,455
<c.simplifiedchinese>这场战斗在所难免</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:11:29,540 --> 00:11:31,417
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…我总觉得…</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:11:36,847 --> 00:11:38,682
<c.simplifiedchinese>我总有种预感…</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:11:39,644 --> 00:11:43,272
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样下去剑心会消失不见…</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:11:47,451 --> 00:11:48,619
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:11:49,122 --> 00:11:51,332
<c.simplifiedchinese>不是你主动发起挑战的吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:11:52,963 --> 00:11:53,797
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:54,632 --> 00:11:56,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>也是</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:11:59,142 --> 00:11:59,976
<c.simplifiedchinese>来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:12:03,150 --> 00:12:05,277
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞天御剑流龙槌闪！</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:12:05,362 --> 00:12:06,905
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么变弱了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:12:06,991 --> 00:12:08,868
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然剑心是最强的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:12:08,953 --> 00:12:11,205
<c.simplifiedchinese>打算这样避开吗 拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:12:11,291 --> 00:12:12,750
<c.simplifiedchinese>对空牙突？</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:12:14,005 --> 00:12:14,839
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:12:16,969 --> 00:12:19,972
<c.simplifiedchinese>想通过扭身来避开串刺</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:12:20,058 --> 00:12:21,768
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过…太天真了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:12:25,987 --> 00:12:30,074
<c.simplifiedchinese>刺突即使被避开了
也能马上变换成横向攻击</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:12:30,787 --> 00:12:34,291
<c.simplifiedchinese>战术鬼才新选组副长土方岁三</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:12:34,378 --> 00:12:38,424
<c.simplifiedchinese>发明的这招“平刺突”根本没有死角</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:12:39,013 --> 00:12:41,891
<c.simplifiedchinese>再加上我的牙突 更是所向披靡</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:44,315 --> 00:12:50,613
<c.simplifiedchinese>在实战中
两次遭遇同一敌人的情况非常罕见</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:12:51,329 --> 00:12:55,541
<c.simplifiedchinese>因此只要有确保一击打倒敌人的技能</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:55,629 --> 00:12:58,548
<c.simplifiedchinese>就不需要其他的技能</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:58,635 --> 00:13:02,097
<c.simplifiedchinese>坚持磨练自己的得意技能</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:13:02,184 --> 00:13:04,853
<c.simplifiedchinese>直到将它升华有绝对把握的必杀技</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:13:05,649 --> 00:13:08,068
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组真正的强大之处</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:13:08,154 --> 00:13:11,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>并不是集团战术 而在于此</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:13:16,004 --> 00:13:18,464
<c.simplifiedchinese>破坏对方的武器！</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:13:18,550 --> 00:13:19,676
<c.simplifiedchinese>没用的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:13:24,186 --> 00:13:25,521
<c.simplifiedchinese>虽然没有名字</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:13:25,605 --> 00:13:31,611
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我的爱刀
从幕末到现在陪我度过许多危难</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:13:32,244 --> 00:13:35,331
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝不是能被如今的你轻易折断的货色</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:13:36,627 --> 00:13:38,546
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:13:43,558 --> 00:13:45,143
<c.simplifiedchinese>让开 小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:13:47,191 --> 00:13:48,567
<c.simplifiedchinese>你很碍事</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:13:55,165 --> 00:13:56,083
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:56,751 --> 00:13:58,002
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:14:01,177 --> 00:14:03,763
<c.simplifiedchinese>对于冲着刀来的第二击的反击</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:14:04,558 --> 00:14:08,479
<c.simplifiedchinese>必须比第一击还要更快</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:14:08,566 --> 00:14:12,028
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的胸部受了相当重的伤</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:14:12,116 --> 00:14:13,325
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:14:14,286 --> 00:14:18,707
<c.simplifiedchinese>他在这里停留的短短一段时间内</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:14:18,795 --> 00:14:20,213
<c.simplifiedchinese>与许多敌人交过手</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:14:20,298 --> 00:14:24,553
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一定学会了如何唤起
刽子手时的实力来获得胜利</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:14:25,767 --> 00:14:27,894
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然跟我预料的一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:14:28,481 --> 00:14:30,483
<c.simplifiedchinese>当他拿起剑时</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:14:30,569 --> 00:14:36,116
<c.simplifiedchinese>都会不自觉地
逐渐回复到刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:14:38,752 --> 00:14:40,545
<c.simplifiedchinese>比之前还快吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:14:41,382 --> 00:14:42,258
<c.simplifiedchinese>消失了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:14:43,051 --> 00:14:44,052
<c.simplifiedchinese>下面？</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:14:48,104 --> 00:14:49,647
<c.simplifiedchinese>刚才那下怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:14:50,567 --> 00:14:54,112
<c.simplifiedchinese>远远超出我的预想</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:14:56,162 --> 00:14:58,247
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的呼吸非常急促…</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:14:58,750 --> 00:15:03,588
<c.simplifiedchinese>发挥出了意料之外的力量
身体跟不上了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:15:13,154 --> 00:15:14,739
<c.simplifiedchinese>-难道…
-难道…</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:15:15,867 --> 00:15:17,702
<c.simplifiedchinese>因为跟我交手</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:15:17,788 --> 00:15:20,833
<c.simplifiedchinese>十年前的感觉显著复苏</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:15:21,337 --> 00:15:24,090
<c.simplifiedchinese>一下子变回了拔刀斋吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:15:25,595 --> 00:15:29,516
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是只是单纯的战意激昂呢？</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:15:32,609 --> 00:15:33,944
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要找出答案…</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:15:37,911 --> 00:15:39,621
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有用这招了</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:15:40,208 --> 00:15:42,544
<c.simplifiedchinese>真真正正的牙突</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:15:43,046 --> 00:15:44,339
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不会再手下留情了</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:15:45,260 --> 00:15:48,263
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？他刚才一直在手下留情？</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:15:55,029 --> 00:15:55,863
<c.simplifiedchinese>好快！</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:15:55,947 --> 00:15:59,701
<c.simplifiedchinese>但他好像完全忘了
后面还有第二下横向攻击</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:15:59,788 --> 00:16:02,291
<c.simplifiedchinese>果然只是单纯的战意激昂吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:16:12,439 --> 00:16:13,273
<c.simplifiedchinese>好厉害！</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:16:13,358 --> 00:16:17,278
<c.simplifiedchinese>不仅避开了攻击
还利用离心力狠狠在背后一击！</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:16:17,866 --> 00:16:21,495
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算牙突再厉害
这么短的时间内见识了四次</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:16:21,582 --> 00:16:27,755
<c.simplifiedchinese>再傻的人也能想出一两个破解招式吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:16:29,556 --> 00:16:30,766
<c.simplifiedchinese>站起来 斋藤</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:16:31,477 --> 00:16:36,524
<c.simplifiedchinese>时隔十年的决斗
就这样了结也太无趣了</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:16:41,706 --> 00:16:42,999
<c.simplifiedchinese>好啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:16:43,083 --> 00:16:44,751
<c.simplifiedchinese>我改变想法了</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:16:45,714 --> 00:16:47,716
<c.simplifiedchinese>我要杀了你</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:16:47,801 --> 00:16:49,594
<c.simplifiedchinese>别做梦了</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:16:49,680 --> 00:16:53,225
<c.simplifiedchinese>要杀了你的人应该是在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:16:59,073 --> 00:17:00,199
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰！</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:17:01,412 --> 00:17:02,580
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟那时一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:17:03,331 --> 00:17:06,501
<c.simplifiedchinese>跟刃卫交手那时完全一样…</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:17:07,089 --> 00:17:10,468
<c.simplifiedchinese>再这样下去 “剑心”就会消失了…</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:17:12,016 --> 00:17:13,309
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁能…</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:17:13,394 --> 00:17:14,437
<c.simplifiedchinese>阻止他们…</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:17:16,942 --> 00:17:19,820
<c.simplifiedchinese>谁来阻止他们！</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:17:27,881 --> 00:17:30,592
<c.simplifiedchinese>下次就砍掉你的脑袋</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:17:30,678 --> 00:17:32,388
<c.simplifiedchinese>好厉害…</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:17:32,474 --> 00:17:35,435
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么感觉剑心
今天比平时更疯狂一些？</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:17:35,522 --> 00:17:36,564
<c.simplifiedchinese>不！</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:17:36,649 --> 00:17:37,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>那不是剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:17:38,068 --> 00:17:39,611
<c.simplifiedchinese>是刽子手拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:17:39,696 --> 00:17:40,572
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:17:40,657 --> 00:17:42,200
<c.simplifiedchinese>必须阻止他们！</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:17:42,284 --> 00:17:44,328
<c.simplifiedchinese>不然的话 刽子手拔刀斋就…</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:17:44,414 --> 00:17:47,793
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们没法阻止他们的 小姑娘</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:17:48,506 --> 00:17:49,757
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:17:49,842 --> 00:17:53,846
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们现在不是在明治时代的东京交手</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:17:53,933 --> 00:17:56,269
<c.simplifiedchinese>而是身处幕末的京都</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:17:56,856 --> 00:18:01,235
<c.simplifiedchinese>能阻止他们这场战斗的
只有同样经历过幕末动乱</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:18:01,824 --> 00:18:06,203
<c.simplifiedchinese>体会过京都风云激荡的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:18:06,291 --> 00:18:10,753
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管怎么喊
他们都听不到我们的声音</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:18:16,102 --> 00:18:17,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>川路</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:18:17,606 --> 00:18:21,902
<c.simplifiedchinese>斋藤去神谷道场多久了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:18:23,993 --> 00:18:25,077
<c.simplifiedchinese>大约…</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:18:25,162 --> 00:18:26,747
<c.simplifiedchinese>四个半小时</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:18:26,832 --> 00:18:28,083
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:18:29,045 --> 00:18:31,005
<c.simplifiedchinese>希望我们没来晚</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:18:31,508 --> 00:18:33,177
<c.simplifiedchinese>让马车再快点</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:18:33,261 --> 00:18:34,471
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:18:38,648 --> 00:18:43,152
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组的人还跟以前一样不懂退缩啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:45,951
<c.simplifiedchinese>新选组队规第一条</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:18:46,037 --> 00:18:48,248
<c.simplifiedchinese>“绝不违反武士道”</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:18:48,333 --> 00:18:51,336
<c.simplifiedchinese>阵前逃亡有违武士道！</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:18:51,422 --> 00:18:55,593
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起性命选择了新选组的荣誉啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:18:56,349 --> 00:18:57,850
<c.simplifiedchinese>也好</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:19:00,065 --> 00:19:01,149
<c.simplifiedchinese>空手？</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:19:01,234 --> 00:19:02,944
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果用刀会产生破绽</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:19:03,029 --> 00:19:04,406
<c.simplifiedchinese>胜负已分！</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:19:07,580 --> 00:19:10,041
<c.simplifiedchinese>-腰带？
-他什么时候…</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:19:10,127 --> 00:19:11,545
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:19:13,801 --> 00:19:15,303
<c.simplifiedchinese>-阿剑！
-糟了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:19:15,387 --> 00:19:16,388
<c.simplifiedchinese>这样就…</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:19:16,472 --> 00:19:17,849
<c.simplifiedchinese>结束了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:19:18,894 --> 00:19:20,104
<c.simplifiedchinese>他想勒死剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:19:20,188 --> 00:19:22,566
<c.simplifiedchinese>他可没那么仁慈</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:19:22,652 --> 00:19:23,903
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:19:23,988 --> 00:19:26,365
<c.simplifiedchinese>要折断他的脖子！</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:19:28,831 --> 00:19:31,083
<c.simplifiedchinese>没用的 别再做无用的挣扎了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:19:48,453 --> 00:19:49,829
<c.simplifiedchinese>这真是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:19:49,915 --> 00:19:51,833
<c.simplifiedchinese>幕末的战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:19:51,919 --> 00:19:54,588
<c.simplifiedchinese>两个人都没有余力了</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:19:54,674 --> 00:19:57,511
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一击就是最后一击了</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:19:58,098 --> 00:19:59,599
<c.simplifiedchinese>是死是活</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:19:59,684 --> 00:20:01,478
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是同归于尽…</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:20:03,274 --> 00:20:05,777
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑…心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:07,949
<c.simplifiedchinese>差不多</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:20:08,451 --> 00:20:09,786
<c.simplifiedchinese>是时候做个了结了</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:20:10,372 --> 00:20:11,748
<c.simplifiedchinese>是啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:20:12,543 --> 00:20:13,669
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰！</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:20:14,338 --> 00:20:15,339
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:20:16,342 --> 00:20:17,468
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑…</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:20:20,559 --> 00:20:22,436
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要！</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:20:25,527 --> 00:20:27,362
<c.simplifiedchinese>够了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:20:27,991 --> 00:20:29,868
<c.simplifiedchinese>恢复理智吧 斋藤</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:20:29,953 --> 00:20:34,082
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的任务只是检验拔刀斋的能力</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:20:35,380 --> 00:20:37,299
<c.simplifiedchinese>我正在兴头上呢</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:20:37,384 --> 00:20:40,721
<c.simplifiedchinese>即使是你也不能插手</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:20:42,144 --> 00:20:47,816
<c.simplifiedchinese>你身为新选组成员的骄傲
我已经十分了解</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:20:48,323 --> 00:20:49,157
<c.simplifiedchinese>不过</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:20:49,742 --> 00:20:54,622
<c.simplifiedchinese>不管是你的还是绯村的性命
都不能在这里白白浪费掉</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:20:56,380 --> 00:20:57,590
<c.simplifiedchinese>原来如此</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:20:58,259 --> 00:21:01,554
<c.simplifiedchinese>你就是斋藤一身后的真正指使者</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:21:02,142 --> 00:21:04,728
<c.simplifiedchinese>前萨摩藩维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:21:04,814 --> 00:21:06,983
<c.simplifiedchinese>明治政府内务卿</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:21:07,069 --> 00:21:08,779
<c.simplifiedchinese>大久保利通</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:22:47,436 --> 00:22:51,523
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一集 《明治11年5月14日》</c.simplifiedchinese>

